title: Narrative

Vertical interactive `<<tabs>>` (via `pitch-class="tc-vertical"`) compared to a static render, where the imported `$:/tags/Global/Static` override turns them into static tabs. Static rendering ignores the vertical orientation since each tab becomes its own block-level card.

+
title: Output

''Interactive vertical tabs''

<$let pitch-class="tc-vertical">
<$transclude $tiddler="StaticTabs" $mode="block"/>
</$let>

-----

''Static render (the import sees tv-config-static="yes", so tabs become static-tabs; class="tc-vertical" passes through but has no effect on stacked cards)''

<$let tv-config-static="yes" pitch-class="tc-vertical">
<$importvariables filter="[subfilter{$:/core/config/GlobalImportFilter}]">
<$transclude $tiddler="StaticTabs" $mode="block"/>
</$importvariables>
</$let>
